Tawm sau-ntawv: 1.23, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['1.23'] kab-ntawv), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['1,23'] lej kab-ntawv lej), kab-tshiab. # 1,23 no longer valid
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['1,23'] lej kab-ntawv lej kab-ntawv), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['1.23'] lej, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['1.23'] raw number, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['1.23'] raw number kab-ntawv, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['1.23'] raw number kab-ntawv lej, kab-tshiab.
>> x := (3.5 × 1000000 + 1.5).
Tawm sau-ntawv: x, kab-tshiab.
>> x := (3.5 × 100000 + 0.0001 ).
Tawm sau-ntawv: x, kab-tshiab.
>> x := (3.5 + 1000).
Tawm sau-ntawv: x, kab-tshiab.
x := x kab-ntawv.
Tawm sau-ntawv: x, kab-tshiab.
>> y := x lej.
Tawm sau-ntawv: y, kab-tshiab.